WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

1
00:00:00.141 --> 00:00:02.530
One of the best things about being here at Comic-Con--

2
00:00:02.530 --> 00:00:04.227
(shrieking)

3
00:00:04.227 --> 00:00:05.400
Andy, look out!

4
00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:07.099
Look out, Andy!
(shrieking)

5
00:00:07.099 --> 00:00:08.775
Oh, what, you mean this zombie?

6
00:00:08.775 --> 00:00:10.119
[Conan] Yes, look out!

7
00:00:10.119 --> 00:00:11.856
Oh, come on, Conan.

8
00:00:11.856 --> 00:00:14.428
I mean, zombies get hungry just like everyone else.

9
00:00:14.428 --> 00:00:15.569
And you know what they say.

10
00:00:15.569 --> 00:00:17.778
You're not you when you're hungry.

11
00:00:17.778 --> 00:00:18.695
(laughing)

12
00:00:18.695 --> 00:00:20.626
Here, I'll take care of it.

13
00:00:20.626 --> 00:00:22.183
(growling)

14
00:00:22.183 --> 00:00:23.367
Here you go, buddy.

15
00:00:23.367 --> 00:00:24.298
No, go ahead.

16
00:00:24.298 --> 00:00:25.131
Go ahead.

17
00:00:25.131 --> 00:00:25.964
Take a little bit there.

18
00:00:25.964 --> 00:00:27.631
That's all you need.

19
00:00:29.351 --> 00:00:31.601
(laughing)

20
00:00:31.601 --> 00:00:32.647
Thank you, Andrew.

21
00:00:32.647 --> 00:00:36.295
Oh, you're welcome.
(laughing)

22
00:00:36.295 --> 00:00:39.922
(cheering)
(applauding)

23
00:00:39.922 --> 00:00:40.807
Here.

24
00:00:40.807 --> 00:00:42.044
Conan!

25
00:00:42.044 --> 00:00:42.877
Conan!

26
00:00:43.986 --> 00:00:46.482
Are you enjoying your week at Comic-Con?

27
00:00:46.482 --> 00:00:48.530
Yes, yes, I really am.

28
00:00:48.530 --> 00:00:50.098
Thanks for asking, yes.
Splendid.

29
00:00:50.098 --> 00:00:52.146
And who's on the show this evening?

30
00:00:52.146 --> 00:00:54.780
Oh, we have the cast of LEGO Ninjago Movie.

31
00:00:54.780 --> 00:00:56.666
We have Kumail Nanjani, Olivia Munn.

32
00:00:56.666 --> 00:00:57.884
We have Justin Theroux.

33
00:00:57.884 --> 00:01:01.200
Well, I suppose a bit of Justin Theroux's brain

34
00:01:01.200 --> 00:01:03.250
wouldn't be so bad.

35
00:01:03.250 --> 00:01:04.514
(laughing)

36
00:01:04.514 --> 00:01:06.786
Would you kindly point me in the direction

37
00:01:06.786 --> 00:01:08.748
of your green room?
Oh, yeah, sure, no problem.

38
00:01:08.748 --> 00:01:11.010
take the stairs down, first door on your left,

39
00:01:11.010 --> 00:01:11.843
and then you can't miss it.

40
00:01:11.843 --> 00:01:12.759
Justin should be in there.

41
00:01:12.759 --> 00:01:15.020
Got it, thank you, old chap, Andrew.

42
00:01:15.020 --> 00:01:16.555
Have a marvelous week!

43
00:01:16.555 --> 00:01:20.055 line:15%
(elegant classical music)

44
00:01:23.074 --> 00:01:24.412 line:15%
What a lovely fellow!

45
00:01:24.412 --> 00:01:25.495 line:15%
[Andy] See?

